    "lines": [
      {
        "scene": "hook",
        "text": "Stanley sold $73M a year. Then one cup went viral.",
        "start": 0.3,
        "seconds": 3.24,
        "window": 3.9,
        "fill": 0.831
      },
      {
        "scene": "barely",
        "text": "Not a new cup. Stanley, the old flask maker, already sold this one, and it barely sold.",
        "start": 4.2,
        "seconds": 3.81,
        "window": 4.47,
        "fill": 0.852
      },
      {
        "scene": "blog",
        "text": "So who saw it first? Three women who ran a shopping blog. They bought a batch themselves, sold it to their readers, and it was gone in days.",
        "start": 8.67,
        "seconds": 5.35,
        "window": 6.03,
        "fill": 0.887
      },
      {
        "scene": "boss",
        "text": "So what changed? Stanley hired a new boss from Crocs. He found the blog, and sold the cup to women, in new colours.",
        "start": 14.7,
        "seconds": 5.26,
        "window": 5.93,
        "fill": 0.887
      },
      {
        "scene": "rise",
        "text": "Sales jumped to $94M, climbed to $194M, and hit $402M.",
        "start": 20.63,
        "seconds": 5.56,
        "window": 6.23,
        "fill": 0.892
      },
      {
        "scene": "turn",
        "text": "And Stanley added scarcity: limited colour drops. Shops put up signs limiting how many cups you could buy.",
        "start": 26.87,
        "seconds": 4.6,
        "window": 5.27,
        "fill": 0.873
      },
      {
        "scene": "payoff",
        "text": "Four years later, Stanley was projected to sell more than $750M in a single year.",
        "start": 32.13,
        "seconds": 4.24,
        "window": 4.9,
        "fill": 0.865
      },
      {
        "scene": "ending",
        "text": "Spot one in a cup holder today, and remember: it once barely sold.",
        "start": 37.03,
        "seconds": 2.74,
        "window": 3.4,
        "fill": 0.806
      }
    ]
  },
